      "weather": "Fine",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OZONICA (3) has continued to progress and recorded his first win on a turf surface here nearly 6 weeks ago, adding to his 3 poly track wins. He skips a class to be here, and with that, he drops 2kg. He is on top again. TAROONA (4) is another promising type who resumed with a brave run for second by a head here a fortnight ago. She carries 3kg less this time, and from the pole position, she can go one better. VINO NOVELLO (1) ended his last prep by finishing second at Caulfield in April over 2400m. This trip is well short of his best, but he is a fresh-up winner, and in a small field, he should not get too far out of his ground early on. Watch for him late. OBVIOUSLY GOOD (2) battled on and only peaked late fresh here 2 weeks ago over 1100m. He normally improves with racing, and if he does not need this run, then he can have a say in the finish. WOLFY (5) has recently been bought out of a Melbourne Stable, and any market support would be worth following.",
